"      -D nmtui=true               \\\n"
"      -D ovs=false                \\\n"
"      -D ppp=false                \\\n"
"      -D selinux=false            \\\n"
"      -D qt=false                 \\\n"
"      -D session_tracking=systemd \\\n"
"      -D nm_cloud_setup=false     \\\n"
"      -D modem_manager=false      &amp;&amp;\n"
"ninja</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/networking/netutils/networkmanager.xml:211
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"An already active graphical session with a bus address is necessary to run "
"the tests. To test the results, issue <command>ninja test</command>."
msgstr ""
"Uma sessão gráfica já ativa com endereço de barramento é necessária para "
"executar os testes. Para testar os resultados, emita &quot;<command>ninja "
"test</command>&quot;."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/networking/netutils/networkmanager.xml:217
#, xml-text
msgid "A few tests may fail, depending on enabled kernel options."
msgstr ""
"Uns poucos testes possivelmente falhem, dependendo das opções de núcleo "
"habilitadas."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/networking/netutils/networkmanager.xml:221
#, xml-text
msgid "Now, as the <systemitem class=\"username\">root</systemitem> user:"
msgstr ""
"Agora, como o(a) usuário(a) &quot;<systemitem "
"class=\"username\">root</systemitem>&quot;:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/networking/netutils/networkmanager.xml:224
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput>ninja install &amp;&amp;\n"
"mv -v /usr/share/doc/NetworkManager{,-&NetworkManager-version;}</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput>ninja install &amp;&amp;\n"
"mv -v /usr/share/doc/NetworkManager{,-&NetworkManager-version;}</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/networking/netutils/networkmanager.xml:228
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"If you have not passed the <option>-D docs=true</option> option to "
"<command>meson</command>, you can install the pregenerated manual pages with"
" (as the &root; user):"
msgstr ""
"Se você não passou a opção <option>-D docs=true</option> para "
"<command>meson</command>, você consegue instalar as páginas de manual pré "
"geradas com (como o(a) usuário(a) &root;):"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/networking/netutils/networkmanager.xml:233
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput>for file in $(echo ../man/*.[1578]); do\n"
"    section=${file##*.} &amp;&amp;\n"
"    install -vdm 755 /usr/share/man/man$section\n"
"    install -vm 644 $file /usr/share/man/man$section/\n"
"done</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput>for file in $(echo ../man/*.[1578]); do\n"
"   section=${file##*.} &amp;&amp;\n"
"   install -vdm 755 /usr/share/man/man$section\n"
"   install -vm 644 $file /usr/share/man/man$section/\n"
"done</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/networking/netutils/networkmanager.xml:240
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"If you have not used <option>-D docs=true</option>, the pregenerated HTML "
"documentation can also be installed with (as the &root; user):"
msgstr ""
"Se você não tiver usado <option>-D docs=true</option>, a documentação HTML "
"pré gerada também pode ser instalada com (como o(a) usuário(a) &root;):"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/networking/netutils/networkmanager.xml:246
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput>cp -Rv ../docs/{api,libnm} "
"/usr/share/doc/NetworkManager-&NetworkManager-version;</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput>cp -Rv ../docs/{api,libnm} "
"/usr/share/doc/NetworkManager-&NetworkManager-version;</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><title>
#: blfs-en/networking/netutils/networkmanager.xml:251
#, xml-text
msgid "Command Explanations"
msgstr "Explicações do Comando"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/networking/netutils/networkmanager.xml:258
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<option>-D docs=true</option>: Use this switch to enable building man pages "
"and documentation if <xref linkend=\"gtk-doc\"/> is installed."
msgstr ""
"<option>-D docs=true</option>: Use essa chave para habilitar construir "
"páginas de manual e documentação se <xref linkend=\"gtk-doc\"/> estiver "
"instalado."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/networking/netutils/networkmanager.xml:263
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<parameter>-D nmtui=true</parameter>: This switch enables building "
"<command>nmtui</command>."
msgstr ""
"<parameter>-D nmtui=true</parameter>: Essa chave habilita construir "
"<command>nmtui</command>."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/networking/netutils/networkmanager.xml:268
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<parameter>-D systemdsystemunitdir=no</parameter> and <parameter>-D "
"systemd_journal=false</parameter>: systemd is not used for sysv init "
"systems, so prevent installing units and using the systemd journal."
msgstr ""
"<parameter>-D systemdsystemunitdir=no</parameter> e <parameter>-D "
"systemd_journal=false</parameter>: systemd não é usado para sistemas de "
"inicialização SysV, de forma que evite instalar unidades e usar o diário do "
"systemd."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/networking/netutils/networkmanager.xml:275
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<parameter>-D ovs=false</parameter>: This switch disable the Open vSwitch "
"integration because it needs <xref linkend='jansson'/>.  Remove it if you "
"have <xref linkend='jansson'/> installed on your system."
msgstr ""
"<parameter>-D ovs=false</parameter>: Essa chave desabilita a integração do "
"Open vSwitch porque ela precisa de <xref linkend='jansson'/>. Remova-a se "
"você tiver <xref linkend='jansson'/> instalado em teu sistema."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/networking/netutils/networkmanager.xml:282
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<parameter>-D modem_manager=false</parameter>: This switch is required if "
"<application>ModemManager</application> is not installed. Omit this switch "
"if you have built <application>ModemManager</application> and "
"<application>mobile-broadband-provider-info</application>."
msgstr ""
"<parameter>-D modem_manager=false</parameter>: Essa chave é exigida se o "
"<application>ModemManager</application> não estiver instalado. Omita essa "
"chave se você tiver construído <application>ModemManager</application> e "
"<application>mobile-broadband-provider-info</application>."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/networking/netutils/networkmanager.xml:289
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<parameter>-D session_tracking=elogind</parameter>: This switch is used to "
"set <command>elogind</command> as the default program for session tracking."
msgstr ""
"<parameter>-D session_tracking=elogind</parameter>: Essa chave é usada para "
"configurar <command>elogind</command> como o aplicativo padrão para "
"rastreamento de sessão."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/networking/netutils/networkmanager.xml:295
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<parameter>-D session_tracking=systemd</parameter>: This switch is used to "
"set <command>systemd-logind</command> as the default program for session "
"tracking."
msgstr ""
"<parameter>-D session_tracking=systemd</parameter>: Essa chave é usada para "
"configurar <command>systemd-logind</command> como o aplicativo padrão para "
"rastreamento de sessão."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/networking/netutils/networkmanager.xml:301
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<parameter>-D ppp=false</parameter>: This switch disables "
"<application>PPP</application> support in "
"<application>NetworkManager</application> since the programs necessary for "
"it are not installed. Remove this switch if you need PPP support and have "
"<application>PPP</application> installed."
msgstr ""
"<parameter>-D ppp=false</parameter>: Essa chave desabilita suporte a "
"<application>PPP</application> no <application>NetworkManager</application>,"
" já que os aplicativos necessários para isso não estão instalados. Remova "
"essa chave se você precisar de suporte a PPP e tiver o "
"<application>PPP</application> instalado."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/networking/netutils/networkmanager.xml:309
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<parameter>-D libaudit=no</parameter> and <parameter>-D "
"selinux=false</parameter>: This switch disables support for libaudit and "
"SELinux since they are not used in BLFS."
msgstr ""
"<parameter>-D libaudit=no</parameter> e <parameter>-D "
"selinux=false</parameter>: Essa chave desabilita o suporte para libaudit e "
"SELinux, vez que ele(a) não é usado(a) no BLFS."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/networking/netutils/networkmanager.xml:315
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<parameter>-D qt=false</parameter>: This switch disables the <application>Qt"
" 5</application> examples."
msgstr ""
"<parameter>-D qt=false</parameter>: Essa chave desabilita os exemplos do "
"<application>Qt 5</application>."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/networking/netutils/networkmanager.xml:320
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<option>-D crypto=gnutls</option>: Use this switch if you have GnuTLS "
"installed and want to use it for certificate and key operations in "
"NetworkManager, instead of using NSS (the default)."
msgstr ""
"<option>-D crypto=gnutls</option>: Use essa chave se você tiver GnuTLS "
"instalado e quiser usá-lo para operações de certificados e chaves no "
"NetworkManager, em vez de usar o NSS (o padrão)."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/networking/netutils/networkmanager.xml:326
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<option>-D crypto=null</option>: Use this switch if neither NSS nor GnuTLS "
"is installed but you want to build NetworkManager anyway.  This switch will "
"make NetworkManager lack some features (for example 802.1X)."
msgstr ""
"<option>-D crypto=null</option>: Use essa chave se nem NSS nem GnuTLS "
"estiverem instalados, mas você quiser construir NetworkManager de qualquer "
"maneira. Essa chave fará com que NetworkManager careça de alguns recursos "
"(por exemplo, 802.1X)."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/networking/netutils/networkmanager.xml:344
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<option>-D nm_cloud_setup=false</option>: Use this switch if you have not "
"installed <xref linkend='jansson'/>. This disables nm-cloud-setup which is "
"used to automatically configure the network in a public cloud environment "
"within a VM."
msgstr ""
"<option>-D nm_cloud_setup=false</option>: Use essa chave se você não tiver "
"instalado <xref linkend='jansson'/>. Isso desabilita o nm-cloud-setup que é "
"usado para configurar automaticamente a rede de intercomunicação em um "
"ambiente de nuvem pública dentro de uma VM."

